  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fighting Seven Extreme Desolation and Calamity Luck Altar, Duke Long activates this immortal killer move. It is not that those two fail to retaliate, but every attack they land is stopped. He holds an extremely huge dominance as time continues to pass against Longevity Heaven.",
