      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In Heavenly Court, countless dragon shaped tattoos float around Duke Long’s body and block daybreak sword attacks from Myriad Year Flying Warship. This is his main defensive killer move. Nine is a general number implying countless tattoos. It is a rare passive defensive method. The tattoos usually stay hidden on his skin, and when there is an attack they activate automatically, without needing his wills or thoughts to be maintained. Fang Yuan collects information during the battle to break the move, but his gains are minimal.",
